            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> "Thesaurus:C83039 (http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C83039)" .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/ptro/DKFZ000054
