            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Qualifier for anatomical location or specimen further detailing the portion or totality, which means arrangement of, or apportioning of. Examples: ENTIRE, SINGLE, SEGMENT, MANY." ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> "Thesaurus:C119850 (http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C119850)" .


