            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LBMETHOD" ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Method of the test or examination. Examples: EIA (Enzyme Immunoassay), ELECTROPHORESIS, DIPSTICK" ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> "Thesaurus:C83312 (http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C83312)" .


