            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Descriptive name given to a specific Trial Arm (e.g., Low Dose, Mid Dose, 10 mg/kg/day dose, Third Arm) to which the subject was assigned." .


###  https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/ptro/DKFZ000118
:DKFZ000118 rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
            rdfs:domain <http://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/xml/owl/EVS/Thesaurus.owl#C69256> ;
